    "https://www.paycomonline.net/v4/ats/web.php/portal/0360F3B5A2EC741788B51C99C6E17513/jobs/384713": {
      "title": "Assistant/Associate Professor of Business",
      "description": "Assistant/Associate Professor of Business You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Assistant/Associate Professor of Business Hot Job Midway University - Midway, KY 40347 Apply Overview Position Type Full Time Education Level Graduate Degree Category Education Apply Description Assistant/Associate Professor – Business Administration Expected Start: Fall 2027 Midway University invites applicants for a fulltime Assistant/Associate Professor of Business Administration in the School of Business, Equine and Sport Studies. The School of Business, Equine and Sport Studies at Midway University has experienced rapid growth over the last 8 years. The Bachelor’s in Business Administration is the largest undergraduate program and the MBA is our largest graduate degree. The successful candidate will join a team of 17 fulltime faculty. At the undergraduate level, we offer minors or concentrations in the areas of leadership, human resource management, finance, entrepreneurship, marketing and bourbon studies. Midway University is a non-tenure granting institution but has a structured path for rank advancement based on teaching, scholarship and service. Duties: The successful candidate will develop and teach courses the University’s MBA program and undergraduate business programs. Courses will be taught both in face-to-face and online formats. Teaching will primarily be at the graduate level with some undergraduate teaching opportunities. The candidate must be able to communicate effectively and work cooperatively with colleagues. All faculty are expected to advise students, serve on committees, be engaged in campus life, and maintain currency in the field. Research in the field is encouraged, but not required. Qualifications Minimum Qualifications: Doctorate in Management or Doctorate in Business Administration with preference given to expertise in  entrepreneurship or finance.. ABD candidates will also be considered. At this time, Midway University is unable to provide new employment visa sponsorship. Consideration will be given to candidates who are already legally authorized to work for any employer in the United States. Review of applicant materials will begin mid-September and will continue until position is filled. Midway University is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
