      "title": "CDL Driver",
      "description": "CDL Driver You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account CDL Driver Hot Job Midway University - Midway, KY 40347 Apply Overview Position Type Part Time Apply Description CDL Driver – Athletics (As-Needed Position) Midway University is seeking a CDL Driver to support our Athletics Department by transporting athletic teams to and from competitions and events. This is an as-needed , part-time position with flexible hours based on team schedules and travel needs. Some overnight travel may be required. Responsibilities: Safely transport student-athletes, coaches, and staff to designated locations using university vehicles. Ensure adherence to all traffic and safety regulations. Conduct pre-trip and post-trip vehicle inspections. Maintain a clean and professional vehicle environment. May be asked to provide transport for other departments, as needed. Qualifications Requirements: High School Diploma or GED Valid Commercial Driver’s License (CDL) with passenger endorsement. Clean driving record and prior commercial driving experience preferred. Ability to work flexible hours, including evenings and weekends. Commitment to the safety and well-being of student-athletes. Join a supportive, team-oriented environment where you’ll play a key role in the success of Midway’s athletic programs. Review of applications will begin immediately and the position will remain open until filled. Midway University is an equal opportunity employer. Share job details to Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
